# Engine node service account token (machine-local secret).
# The engine presents this as a Bearer credential on POST /v1/nodes.
# Procedure: create the ENGINE-NODE-01 service account and sign in as it
# to get an access token — see DEPLOYMENT.md "First-time setup".
# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) next to it and fill in the value;
# the engine reads its process environment, so export it into the engine
# process (shell export, systemd EnvironmentFile, ...). No loader is
# committed. Never commit the actual value, never log it.
RAVEN_ENGINE_TOKEN=
